## Code Style

JavaScript ES6+ with React 18.2.0:
- Prefer functional components and hooks
- Use TypeScript-style JSDoc annotations for props/return types
- Name custom hooks with `use` prefix (e.g., `useDataFetch`, `useTheme`)
- Keep components and utilities modular and reusable
- Follow Tailwind CSS class conventions for styling

